eigen_dkmqshell_subspace.out
Plate 1 x 1 m, t = 10 mm, simply supported, free vibration, 4 x 4 DKMQShell mesh, subspace iteration (stype 1), same values as eigen_dkmqshell_lanczos.in. Theory (Kirchhoff, consistent mass): omega_1^2 = (2 pi^2)^2 D / (rho t) = 9.545e+04; lumped mass on a coarse mesh gives lower values
EigenValueDynamic nroot 4 rtolv 1.e-10 stype 1 smtype 0 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3dShell
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 25 nelem 16 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 4 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 7
node 1 coords 3 0.000000 0.000000 0.0
node 2 coords 3 0.250000 0.000000 0.0
